    "text": "\"It Was Like A Playoff Game\" | Lindy Ruff After 4-1 Win In Dallas | Buffalo SabresBuffalo Sabres head coach Lindy Ruff spoke to the media after a 4-1 win over the Dallas Stars on December 31, 2025. Ruff talked about the team's effort in the game after trailing early on and coming back to win their tenth straight game. He talked about the play of Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen in the game and the goals from Tage Thompson, Bo Byram and Josh Doan. Subscribe to the Buffalo Sabres YT Channel: https://bit.ly/2G1G8eT For More Sabres Action: https://bufsabres.co/2XAYg5m #BuffaloSabres #Sabres #NHL For more Sabres action: Sabres.com Follow us on X: twitter.com/BuffaloSabres Follow us on TikTok: https://bufsabres.co/TikTok Follow us on Instagram: Instagram.com/buffalosabres Like us on Facebook: facebook.com/buffalosabres",
